.TH PARDUS-DOMAIN-JOINER-CLI 1 "2025-01-01" "Pardus Domain Joiner" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
pardus-domain-joiner-cli \- Command-line tool for joining, leaving and managing domain settings on Pardus

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pardus-domain-joiner-cli
<command> [options]

.SH DESCRIPTION
Pardus Domain Joiner CLI is a command-line tool used to join a system to a domain, leave a domain,
check domain connection status, display domain discovery information, or change the system hostname.
Most commands require root privileges.

.SH COMMANDS

.SH JOIN
.B pardus-domain-joiner-cli join
service domain user [options]

Joins the system to a domain using either the \fBsssd\fR or \fBwinbind\fR service.

.TP
.B service
Service to use: \fBsssd\fR or \fBwinbind\fR (required).

.TP
.B domain
Domain name (required).

.TP
.B user
Username (required).

.TP
.B -p, --password
Password. If not provided, it will be securely prompted.

.TP
.B --ou
Organizational Unit (optional).

.TP
.B --workgroup
Workgroup name (optional, only for winbind).

.TP
.B --hostname
Computer name. If omitted, the current hostname is used.

.PP
Example:
.PP
.EX
sudo pardus-domain-joiner-cli join sssd example.com admin
.EE

The program will prompt for a password.

---

.SH LEAVE
.B pardus-domain-joiner-cli leave
user [options]

Removes the system from the currently joined domain.

.TP
.B user
Username (required).

.TP
.B -p, --password
Password. If not supplied, it will be asked interactively.

.PP
Example:
.PP
.EX
sudo pardus-domain-joiner-cli leave admin
.EE

---

.SH STATUS
.B pardus-domain-joiner-cli status

Displays the current domain connection status.

.PP
Example:
.EX
sudo pardus-domain-joiner-cli status
.EE

---

.SH INFO
.B pardus-domain-joiner-cli info
domain

Shows domain discovery and related information for the specified domain.

.TP
.B domain
Domain name (required).

.PP
Example:
.EX
sudo pardus-domain-joiner-cli info example.com
.EE

---

.SH CHANGE
.B pardus-domain-joiner-cli change
hostname

Changes the system hostname.

.TP
.B hostname
New hostname (required).

.PP
Example:
.EX
sudo pardus-domain-joiner-cli change newhostname
.EE

---

.SH VERSION
.B pardus-domain-joiner-cli version

Displays the CLI version.

.PP
Example:
.EX
pardus-domain-joiner-cli version
.EE

---

.SH NOTES
.IP \[bu]
If no password is provided, the program securely prompts for one.
.IP \[bu]
Most commands require root privileges.
.IP \[bu]
The \fBworkgroup\fR parameter is only used with the winbind service.

---

.SH AUTHOR
Pardus Development Team

.SH SEE ALSO
sssd(8), winbind(8)
